  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:100%; text-align:center; margin-bottom:0px; clear:both;\">\n<div style=\"min-width:5.0em; max-width:12em; float:left; border: 1.5px solid #000; -moz-border-radius-topright: 4px; -moz-border-radius-topleft: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-top-left-radius: 4px; -webkit-border-top-right-radius: 4px; -webkit-border-top-left-radius: 4px; padding: .0em 0.5em; height:2em; margin-bottom:10px; background-color:#E8D151;\">\n<table style=\"height:100%;width:100%;\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\"><span style=\"color:#000;\">Basic</span></a></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"min-width:5.0em; max-width:12em; float:left; border: 1.5px solid #333; -moz-border-radius-topright: 4px; -moz-border-radius-topleft: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-top-left-radius: 4px; -webkit-border-top-right-radius: 4px; -webkit-border-top-left-radius: 4px; padding: .0em 0.5em; height:2em; margin-bottom:10px; background-color:#FFF; color: black; font-size:100%;\">\n<table style=\"height:100%;width:100%;\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#000;\">Absolute</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><br style=\"clear:both;\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absolute Superpower Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/9f/The_Hollow_%28Charmed%29.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200103030919\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The Hollow\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/9f/The_Hollow_%28Charmed%29.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20200103030919\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/9f/The_Hollow_%28Charmed%29.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20200103030919 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/9f/The_Hollow_%28Charmed%29.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200103030919 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The Hollow\" width=\"270\" height=\"132\" data-image-key=\"The_Hollow.gif\" data-image-name=\"The Hollow.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Hollow (Charmed) threatens to absorb the magical powers of any and all beings, good or evil.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb all powers.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb any/all powers</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Manipulation/Absolute\" title=\"Superpower Manipulation/Absolute\">Absolute Superpower Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Omni-Absorption\">Omni-Absorption</a>. Ultimate version of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSuperpower_Absorption%2FAbsolute%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absolute/Almighty/Complete/Omni Power Absorption</li>\n<li>Perfect/Ultimate/Total/True Power Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSuperpower_Absorption%2FAbsolute%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb absolutely any and all powers. This means powers on a low, supernatural, almighty, to a meta/omni level and completely removing them from the original source by absorbing. \n</p><p>The powers that they absorb can also be used for other applications other than just acquiring new abilities, such as converting the power as sustenance and/or augment the user’s physical and mental capabilities to immeasurable levels, and can augment any other powers the user may possess, like if they were to absorb a power they already have the power will simply become stronger than it was before. \n</p><p>Also, the mechanics of this ability can even extend to not only absorbing an individual’s powers but also their own physical strength, stamina and even their life-span, which can be used to add to the user’s own body and power. They can even absorb other energy-based properties such as elemental energies, magical and supernatural substances, etc.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpo